        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9d679ec65dc0444aa7b2588667344a13",
      "statement": "AGENTS.md codifies the sensitive data classes that must never appear in logs: Vercel credentials (SANDBOX_VERCEL_TOKEN, SANDBOX_VERCEL_TEAM_ID, SANDBOX_VERCEL_PROJECT_ID), user IDs and PII, file paths and repository URLs, branch names and commit messages, error details that may embed sensitive context, and any dynamic value that exposes system internals.",
