        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9d202c8a096e4db0a904696951046fab",
      "statement": "redactSensitiveInfo runs three passes over the input string, in order: provider-specific API key patterns (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-..., OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-..., GITHUB_TOKEN=gh[pousr]_, GitHub auth-in-URL, Bearer, generic TOKEN, SANDBOX_VERCEL_*); a JSON field pattern that replaces \"teamId\"/\"projectId\" string values with \"[REDACTED]\"; and an environment-variable catch-all that matches any uppercase name ending in KEY, TOKEN, SECRET, PASSWORD, TEAM_ID, or PROJECT_ID followed by an alphanumeric value of at least 8 characters. Every matched value is masked with first-4 + max(8, len-8) stars + last-4 (full stars for values of 8 or fewer characters), preserving the variable name so the UI can tell which key leaked.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/utils/logging.ts#L6-L74",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6a23ea38853ca82d640df4e4f411d1ab7d8b0f2ea066dc3a546fc38b01516536:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_344d99ac23b74aaaaa6776108c2be78c",
      "statement": "Every persisted log entry in tasks.logs passes through redactSensitiveInfo at least once, because createLogEntry in lib/utils/logging.ts invokes it before returning. Additionally, every per-agent runAndLogCommand helper in lib/sandbox/creation.ts and lib/sandbox/agents/{claude,codex,copilot,cursor,gemini,opencode}.ts redacts the shell command, stdout, and stderr before passing them to TaskLogger.command/info/error. opencode.ts has an extra fullCommand.replace(/API_KEY=\"[^\"]*\"/g, 'API_KEY=\"[REDACTED]\"') step for inline API_KEY=\"...\" prefixes, and claude.ts has a fullCommand.replace(aiGatewayKey, '[REDACTED]') step for the AI Gateway launch command.",
