      "id": "claim_6393fb8b5b6245e88486c7ebc5004b19",
      "statement": "AGENTS.md's Configuration Security > Environment Variables section forbids logging or client-exposing SANDBOX_VERCEL_TOKEN, SANDBOX_VERCEL_TEAM_ID, SANDBOX_VERCEL_PROJECT_ID, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY, GEMINI_API_KEY, CURSOR_API_KEY, GH_TOKEN/GITHUB_TOKEN, JWE_SECRET, ENCRYPTION_KEY, and any user-provided API key. The companion client-safe rule limits the NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix to exactly NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_PROVIDERS and NEXT_PUBLIC_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID.",
