    {
      "id": "claim_f67b9f2ad51549ecbed1bf07eb07ed4d",
      "statement": "AGENTS.md defines two grep commands under Testing Changes that detect template literals in user-facing logs (grep -r \"logger\\.(info|error|success|command)\\(`.*\\${\" .\" and grep -r \"console\\.(log|error|warn|info)\\(`.*\\${\" .\"), and a Compliance Checklist that must be completed before submission, including no template literals with ${} in any log statements, all logger calls using static strings, all console calls using static strings for user-facing logs, and UI verification of no data leakage.",
